-help-you-in-learning-a-development-9hp">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>自动化 Godot 4 GLB 资产管线：顶点轴心归位、碰撞体、遮挡器与 MeshLibrary 烘焙</title><link>https://dev.to/eachtouch/automating-godot-4-glb-asset-pipelines-vertex-pivot-grounding-colliders-occluders-meshlibrary-2obk</link><description>教你把上百个模块化 GLB 模型批量导入 Godot 4，自动归位轴心、加上碰撞体与遮挡器并烘焙成 MeshLibrary，让关卡搭建顺手得多。</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:42:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5b892b07803434dd0dba9c2fcd5585f32d12aa52</guid><source url="https://dev.to/eachtouch/automating-godot-4-glb-asset-pipelines-vertex-pivot-grounding-colliders-occluders-meshlibrary-2obk">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>NESkit Studio：一台能做真正 NES 游戏的幻想主机</title><link>https://dev.to/hani_craft_25ec13b5be0d40/neskit-studio-a-fantasy-console-for-nes-3e81</link><description>用 C99 与 cc65 打造的幻想主机，内置精灵、地图、音效、音乐追踪器与代码编辑器，让 NES 游戏开发变得更顺手。</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:14:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a2f51eb59dd4b29bd3e08b88a814e758df4bed6d</guid><source url="https://dev.to/hani_craft_25ec13b5be0d40/neskit-studio-a-fantasy-console-for-nes-3e81">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>GTA 6 势头凶猛、Netflix Games 裁员与皮克敏 Bloom 的意外崛起 | 本周手游播客</title><link>https://www.pocketgamer.biz/gta-6-goes-gangbusters-week-in-mobile-games-podcast</link><description>第 111 期播客聊本周手游圈大事：GTA 6 热度爆棚、Netflix Games 裁员，以及 Pikmin Bloom 的意外翻红。</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f6a3d7d172a869756477a0c4ddf4658960e1374e</guid><source url="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/gta-6-goes-gangbusters-week-in-mobile-games-podcast">PocketGamer.biz</source></item><item><title>在美国做儿童游戏：写代码前要先定好的八件事</title><link>https://gamedev.net/blogs/entry/2298704-making-a-game-for-kids-in-the-us-eight-things-to-settle-before-anyone-writes-code</link><description>给美国孩子做游戏，真正的难题不在玩法，而在数据、广告、商店规则和七岁孩子怎么读懂你的界面。</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 15:52:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">c8e6b737d9052439f5f5265a7